; village_garden.room - the garden at the foot of the waterfall that feeds the village river (design drafts/camada_pessoal.md
; section 1; architecture/story-05-playable-flashbacks, "The garden rebuilt"). Entered from lake_waterfall_path's east stub
; (rows 16-19, floor row 20). A grass bank one row deep (row 20) over the lake (`w`, rows 21-23), which the bank and the
; cliff's stone (cols 36-39, rows 0-20) hold Ivo above: nobody falls in. The cliff and the fall are drawn over that stone
; (Contents/Falls). Left to right the dressing marks the old tree and its swing, the flower beds, the flat stone, the
; lantern and the waterfall (Contents/Marks). No bench, no creatures. Its well is GardenWell in home_village.tscn.
; Twin rule: the grid and water of garden_past.room equal these.

